  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/More-Chest-Varient/img/MCV.png\" width=\"625\" height=\"195\"></div>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/Universal/strip.png\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a style=\"margin-right:0.5rem;margin-left:0.5rem\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsA42pp6cuX\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=555555&labelColor=5C27CE&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right:0.5rem;margin-left:0.5rem\" href=\"https://github.com/LieOnLion/Enderite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=555555&labelColor=5C27CE&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right:0.5rem;margin-left:0.5rem\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@lieonlion?sub_confirmation=1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=555555&labelColor=5C27CE&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right:0.5rem;margin-left:0.5rem\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lieonlion_/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=555555&labelColor=5C27CE&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right:0.5rem;margin-left:0.5rem\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-chest-variants-lieonlion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=555555&labelColor=5C27CE&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right:0.5rem;margin-left:0.5rem\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/LieOnLion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Patreon&color=555555&labelColor=5C27CE&style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon&logoColor=white\" height=\"28\"></a></div>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/Universal/strip.png\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">Этот мод добавляет больше вариантов сундуков в Minecraft!<br>Заполните свои постройки красивыми красочными сундуками</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6 style=\"text-align:center\">Добавляя разнообразные новые сундуки, этот мод делает ваши постройки более завершёнными, предлагая варианты под любой стиль! Хранение вещей становится ещё красочнее</h6>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/LieOnLion/MCV-BiomeMakeover/blob/main/Chests.png?raw=true\" width=\"854\"></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">Добавляет все 4 типа дерева из Biome Makeover.</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">Это дополнение к модам: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-chest-variants-lieonlion\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Chest Variants</a> и <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbiome-makeover\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biome Makeover</a></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/Universal/strip.png\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderite-lieonlion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://lieonlion.github.io/LieOnLion/Enderite/enderite-banner.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gilded-armor-lieonlion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/Gilded-Armor/img/gildedarmor-banner.png\" width=\"199\" height=\"40\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLieOnLion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/222836eb-4419-4635-a203-38e25508d7ba.webp\" width=\"838\" height=\"140\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/Universal/strip.png\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>",
